Package: hotspot-manager-gui
Version: 2.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-pyqt5, python3-pyqt5.qtsvg, pkexec, polkitd, sudo, network-manager, iw
Maintainer: Saimum <saimum@example.com>
Description: Native GUI WiFi Hotspot Manager for Debian
 Manage one or more WiFi hotspots directly from a native desktop
 application — no browser, no terminal, no localhost required.
 .
 Features: multi-adapter network creation, connected device
 management with whitelist/blacklist, scheduled auto on/off and
 idle timeout, QR code sharing, boot-time persistence, and a
 clean Material 3 inspired interface with dark mode support.
 .
 hostapd, dnsmasq, iptables and qrencode are installed on demand
 from the app's Setup page — not automatically at install time.
